    {
      "name": "02 - Auth (JWT)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/auth/register — Fase 3B (OTP, 202 Accepted)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Budi Santoso\",\n  \"email\": \"budi@example.com\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+6281234567890\",\n  \"password\": \"BudiPass123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registrasi (Fase 3B OTP): response 202 Accepted, user dibuat is_active=false, OTP 4-digit dikirim via SMS (mock: lihat log server — [MOCK SMS] to +62xxx: your OTP is 1234). Email DAN nomor HP wajib keduanya (override Fase 3). OTP TIDAK pernah ada di response body."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/auth/verify-otp — Fase 3B (Aktivasi + Tokens)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"otp_code\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "verify-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verifikasi OTP 4 digit (Fase 3B). OTP didapat dari LOG SERVER saat register (mock SMS: \"[MOCK SMS] to +62xxx: your OTP is 1234\"). OTP berlaku 5 menit (OTP_EXPIRY_MINUTES), max 5 percobaan (OTP_MAX_ATTEMPTS). Sukses → is_active=true + access/refresh token. Error codes: OTP_INVALID, OTP_EXPIRED, OTP_ALREADY_USED, OTP_MAX_ATTEMPTS."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/auth/resend-otp — Fase 3B (Cooldown 45 detik)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "resend-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Kirim ulang OTP (Fase 3B). Cooldown 45 detik (OTP_RESEND_COOLDOWN_SECONDS): jika dipanggil terlalu cepat → 400 OTP_RESEND_COOLDOWN + remainingSeconds di data (frontend render countdown 00:45). OTP lama di-invalidate, attempt_count di-reset."
          },
          "response": []
        },
